        "$5$",
        "$7$"
      ],
      "sourceImageRef": null,
      "sourceTextExactParity": "PASS",
      "choicesExactParity": "PASS",
      "contentSha256": "d33699b72ffc09cbcfc16018b7122a8f5a99c57afc82a8db051941b060d88948",
      "choicesSha256": "357cbe347ac1538cbfa1fed43c18add5d227a3f4f8a96b81f68e5781d3b33d75"
    },
    {
      "qid": 2,
      "sourcePosition": {
        "page": 1,
        "region": "left-lower"
      },
      "content": "이차부등식 $x^2+2x-3<0$을 만족시키는 정수 $x$의 개수를 구하시오. [3.1점]",
